# Contact form — Formsubmit.co (https://formsubmit.co)
#
# The contact form posts natively to https://formsubmit.co/varnofitness@gmail.com
# and uses Formsubmit's `_autoresponse` field to send a confirmation back to the
# customer. No access key, no env var, no signup. The form is already activated
# for the live domain (https://varnofitness.com).
#
# If you change the recipient email (GYM_INBOX in src/components/ContactForm.tsx):
#   1. Submit the form once from the live site (https://varnofitness.com/contact/).
#   2. Formsubmit emails the new inbox a confirmation link — click it once.
#   3. Every later submission delivers a tabular email to the gym AND a
#      confirmation email to the customer.
#
# To hide the gym email from the public bundle, replace the URL in
# src/components/ContactForm.tsx with the random Formsubmit hash they email
# after verification (e.g. https://formsubmit.co/abc123…).

# Optional, build-time only (no secrets). Production values are set in
# .github/workflows/deploy.yml. Only override locally to preview the
# github.io project-URL build (see docs/HOSTING_AND_DNS.md).
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://varnofitness.com
# NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_PATH=
